{"job_id":"F-055b998fdff7566db3ce","family_id":"F-055b998fdff7566db3ce","title":"사단령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":3,"target_id":"68124d590d44ca586360746761096c284426e9256bd326b9a4867b2ed8de871f","source_hash":"06eb6c2d0d5474536738521d250a63b7b0b4a51fafd4d139ef89f13931ba1bc1","text":"部门顺序"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":78,"target_id":"31e14473a635d668fd49758b959e4e56fd628ad47941e6facb5d731e755a4861","source_hash":"1e86d24a28ad95a3d77379952e722d60a77142c3907794d6d5b41506bce4e558","text":"第 1 条（安装）\n①陆军应设立师。<2020年12月22日修订>\n② 该师负责其管辖范围内的作战、训练和军事管理事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":78,"end":207,"target_id":"db8c525742825b4dab7e2f10917e2476a618e8ed67f8dff7b7b73c70695901d6","source_hash":"22c6690d0c5a9b1b079f446fab3a1edf31a95bb5560898f32ad47f76a8665478","text":"第二条（名称、隶属关系等）师的名称由总统决定；师的下属单位由陆军参谋长决定；师的驻地由地面作战司令部司令或第二集团军作战司令部司令决定；师的管辖区域由其直接上级决定。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":207,"end":369,"target_id":"dead41f18a2460b02ea0a599a3071a17b2185311c898e75f63fa0b134bfbede9","source_hash":"a50b40fe7ec90ef0e1f4b30d90255bc46c91770b3b5e4e4e77d177ef6f538cab","text":"第三条（部门和单位的设立）\n① 师由师部和必要的作战单位、作战支援单位和作战勤务支援单位（以下简称“编制单位”）组成。\n②有关参谋部门的设立和师部职责划分的事项，由陆军参谋长决定；有关作战部队的设立、任务和组织安排的事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":369,"end":507,"target_id":"04bb934221821628b6f78da9350efaf21c45f867bd7cae9b46d36e8e78ad8ce8","source_hash":"f922166b750dc00af6a03f2db4cfd0b7e7f842b5975ca5b3fa80bc0728055dc9","text":"第四条（师长等的任命）\n① 师部设师长、副师长和参谋长。\n② 师长由陆军将官担任，副师长由陆军将官或校级军官担任，参谋长由陆军校级军官担任。<2017年9月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":507,"end":692,"target_id":"d46451d32107ee87ade9c027f51569d7a0f1d42d51e802fd6e7ab5eb58862424","source_hash":"d345f7a466ca4251a5c3a2dac4f869496276001db234f6cb51d3143c4c652648","text":"第五条（师长等的职责）\n① 师长负责监督师的全面运作，指挥和监督已建立的单位以及隶属于或附属于师的单位（以下简称“指挥单位”）。\n副师长协助师长，并在师长因不可避免的情况无法履行职责时代表师长行事。\n③ 参谋长协助师长，协调、控制和监督参谋工作。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":692,"end":800,"target_id":"fbd64584e34d66a34b6cbb966d1885ce24b279d969cd9b558847b1084861c43e","source_hash":"231d2c07473ec787838711b035b5d99f1edbe76badd899f4d2f1a4b7018f2675","text":"第六条（维护军纪）师长应当维护并执行其管辖范围内所有非其直接上级指挥的陆军部队的军纪。但是，由其直接上级特别指定的部队除外。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":800,"end":1000,"target_id":"ddaf384636fb597471fb016468ed1936049f03a20afd802de337c8938ff11945","source_hash":"66f200afc0a08a004a47c2ab8f83ec2ad688d2863a50482149a7713af8320289","text":"第七条（紧急军事措施）\n① 师长在因军事或灾害原因需要采取紧急措施时，可以临时指挥和监督其管辖范围内的除其管辖单位以外的其他单位（以下简称“其他单位”）。\n② 如果师长根据第 1 款临时指挥或监督了其他单位，他/她应当立即向上级报告情况，并通知该其他单位的上级指挥官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1000,"end":1103,"target_id":"50fc9aac0a4264ac5c9ee2bb3ce92a20a8d76ea936014b9067c1628d671f123f","source_hash":"2ef57ba7686e7042a7808b104fc5c639ba769145852f2a0b8bbb0644ed20b26d","text":"第八条（部队部署）发生灾害或紧急情况时，师长收到特别市市长、大都会市市长、省长或特别自治省省长的部署部队请求，经其上级批准后，可以执行该请求。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1103,"end":1190,"target_id":"569f2e0e9a93ec4fc37990cc712999e87ed5da7f2e6a188b1e7ef8b25ae0773a","source_hash":"8ae2dcdface9a7d7659e90c8bb63a804fd0c279a79cd0dedba729df224195dc7","text":"第九条（师部搬迁的事先批准）  师长因灾害、公共安全或者军事需要而拟搬迁师部时，应当事先获得其上级批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1190,"end":1236,"target_id":"53bae6d192f117cea32842451b4ece969ea80dbd2f0151a8fa6be57208d252a1","source_hash":"1003a687a939a939d6e6ec7f111905e3b93a3f10873b6c035b888aeb56a37aac","text":"第十条（人员配额）军人和文职人员应分配到师级单位，人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1236,"end":1287,"target_id":"5617505ffee2d1241d801065aea2d83c5f611ba1452ae1a88635bfb0b85502d8","source_hash":"daf1c3802b3b128f8ac40d03db6f394c0f73df82e5bbc643fc21d2395af4fc1f","text":"补充规定 <第13122号，1990年9月29日>\n\n本法令自1990年10月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1287,"end":1330,"target_id":"517b3fb700459c1554f28820732f2746bb569bc99cba40c61f18a3f05647c9db","source_hash":"8e83d54285ad65679ca5b47c2d99422bfce984ab2d86c75f068a0c8b69640339","text":"补充规定 <第23055号，2011年8月3日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1330,"end":1363,"target_id":"9488fc88519f12b1b74160d6a57968150d326c0beb2028051e8aff7b6915afc5","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1363,"end":1400,"target_id":"3d5c39ffe509fe8cd915c5a22e08f27a7b94e9e8450cf2e4ceb34e1eb5c138a2","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1400,"end":1414,"target_id":"c84e04f2f23de95b6c5553ed69077b403ba8ed8a812908944df89c75e1a58d21","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1414,"end":1566,"target_id":"b903e93c92d2f31f5f4a82b5aaa53c15a4b10b58ac1e5c41292c484170652357","source_hash":"4c9dbac1fab59d7031c5a8312718f8eafbaeca5293f7f4722f5f7e273cc130f1","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<49>款省略\n\n  <50> 步兵师条例部分修订如下。\n\n  在第4条第2款中，“作为将军”应改为“作为将军”，“作为将军或”应改为“作为将军或”。\n\n  <51> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1566,"end":1598,"target_id":"017af19bee6a6ae2f5ecc248deb8036ad11e8551eda0b3050d3ee347fcf5199c","source_hash":"de588adf60e2b9ab1eae09f068dfaec85007d837e2e47e4243decc39ddef51a7","text":"增补（作战指挥令）<编号 29321，2018 年 12 月 4 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1598,"end":1633,"target_id":"5730c83870621a32372436aaab9a4e092ac04d1356d86f47429296ead30a7bb7","source_hash":"cd0498143f8ddb81f650d569a11c16e832dab70e6930facb820e7b6bf2e62145","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2019年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1633,"end":1641,"target_id":"2e35cd4903d88d2a000335fac48470f3d83ce71ff4b1352224acb4571771ca76","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1641,"end":1697,"target_id":"dde9cb224a00102fe2b8a42b2c695bca7283c77db73e5aa127e854f435ac6de9","source_hash":"5437827b0cf4318cb6c89f9249ca816bc47c2c7e504ce5a5da791c623f716d29","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至⑩ 省略\n\n  ⑪ 步兵师条例部分修订如下。 \n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1697,"end":1857,"target_id":"e03eaee6818d56f7bb81be68a164f13154fcdabf4bae525dd6f99e773df14626","source_hash":"79c448bf6c6cd39239a89d4434d94ba21af22485adcd17a6e3346a473b944e6f","text":"  第 2 条中的“野战集团军司令或第二作战司令”应改为“地面作战司令或集团军第二作战司令”。\n\n  第六条“（维持军纪）”的标题改为“（维持军纪）”，该条正文中除标题外的“军纪”改为“军纪”。\n\n  省略 ⑫ 到 <16>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1857,"end":1865,"target_id":"b86c2bbd4333e9b90907c0f8546e5a8965d1ffdd5261b445e5fce2ebded2b606","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-003644-224271-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1865,"end":1914,"target_id":"938c417a70485cd06b66a2eb4f569db3b34acaea6e183ac5afad02d6134196cd","source_hash":"96e0ae8d7267e2295c96acf9021e13abc99d0ad4e3b1351756681e939cd26a7c","text":"补充规定 <第31275号，2020年12月22日>\n\n本法令自2021年1月1日起生效。"}]}